\par\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 If Joe now believes that just presenting to the public certain arguments can condemn him and his viewers to hell, how can we trust his phylosophical judgment on anything? We already know that he will outright dismiss any arguments that he deems contrary to the catholic doctrine, irrespective of their rationality and soundness, just because he believes they could lead him and his viewers to eternal damnation. He's completely intellectually bankrupt at this point}{ }
